ife!&amp;quot; and it would be all good to all cops, or they would just tut-tut &amp;quot;just one bad apple&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The police are no more accountable than Hillary Clinton - they can violate every right but never go to prison.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Cops are above the law, so they shouldn&amp;#39;t expect law abiding citizens to think of them as anything but evil usurping tyrants.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/695769895549389908/comments/default/4403724779942974688'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/695769895549389908/comments/default/4403724779942974688'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/12/inside-tiny-uncluttered-mind-of-cop.html?showComment=1483134983717#c4403724779942974688' title=''/><author><name>tz</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14446437456939115403</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//2.bp.blogspot.com/_F0DRJg2NK8o/Ss1Hx9sb1cI/AAAAAAAAANs/4WtQjtj4hWU/S220/tzmin64x64.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/12/inside-tiny-uncluttered-mind-of-cop.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-695769895549389908' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/695769895549389908' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1275847194"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 30, 2016 at 2:56 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7592290269089408353</id><published>2016-12-30T14:39:22.597-07:00</published><updated>2016-12-30T14:39:22.597-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Headshakingly sad, pathetic and infuriating in equ...</title><content type='html'>Headshakingly sad, pathetic